    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Researchers at Aga Khan University are partnering with faculty at the University of Virginia and Massachusetts General Hospital, an affiliate of Harvard Medical School, to study the usefulness of a series of technological innovations that will deliver the first-ever insights into the gut health of pregnant women.",
